, the source-visible authorization outcome is therefore unknown rather than a proven allow or deny.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"The declared POST /process/file entry is implemented by process_file and accepts file_id, content, and an optional caller-supplied collection_name.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-fe559de1b09b3607","startLine":1540,"endLine":1543},{"sourceId":"src-fe559de1b09b3607","startLine":1546,"endLine":1552}]},{"id":"f-source-file-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"For a non-admin caller, process_file looks up the file by both file_id and user.id, which is a source-file ownership/visibility check.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-fe559de1b09b3607","startLine":1559,"endLine":1564}]},{"id":"f-destination-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"A supplied collection_name is selected as collection_name and is passed to the vector-database save operation; no destination ownership or grant fact is established by these visible process_file lines.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-fe559de1b09b3607","startLine":1564,"endLine":1569},{"sourceId":"src-fe559de1b09b3607","startLine":1694,"endLine":1706}]},{"id":"f-source-content-flow","kind":"condition","statement":"When collection_name is supplied, process_file obtains document content from the existing file vector data when available, otherwise from file.data['content'], and sets text_content from the file content.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-fe559de1b09b3607","startLine":1595,"endLine":1626}]},{"id":"f-visible-control","kind":"control","statement":"The visible process_file path passes add=True whenever form_data.collection_name is supplied, but the supplied source does not expose the downstream authorization logic, if any, inside save_docs_to_vector_db.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-fe559de1b09b3607","startLine":1694,"endLine":1706}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The destination write sink inserts items into the selected collection through VECTOR_DB_CLIENT.insert(collection_name=collection_name, items=items).","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-fe559de1b09b3607","startLine":1527,"endLine":1533}]},{"id":"f-existing-collection-path","kind":"condition","statement":"For an already existing collection, the visible save helper logic does not return at the add-is-false guard when add is true; the supplied crop then omits the intervening helper lines before the insert sink.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-fe559de1b09b3607","startLine":1458,"endLine":1467},{"sourceId":"src-fe559de1b09b3607","startLine":1527,"endLine":1533}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":["The omitted body of save_docs_to_vector_db between original lines 1468-1526, specifically whether it checks destination collection ownership or an explicit write grant for the non-admin user before calling VECTOR_DB_CLIENT.insert."],"suggestedObservations":["Provide the exact source lines for save_docs_to_vector_db covering original lines 1468-1526, including its user/collection authorization checks and the control path to VECTOR_DB_CLIENT.insert."]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":4843,"output":1400,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":75525.3799,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T09:39:26.015Z"}}
